### Cart Endpoints Verification

@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiI2YTVmODljNzkzYTRkZjYyMWE0MTM1NmIiLCJyb2xlIjoiY3VzdG9tZXIiLCJpYXQiOjE3ODQ2NDYwODcsImV4cCI6MTc4NDY0OTY4N30.o9k5mt5mZwjchxGXoZTA2HK-faKwj7RNfNXNV2VFRcw
@variantA = 6a5f89c793a4df621a413569
@variantB = 6a5f89c793a4df621a41356a

### 1. GET Cart (Expected: Empty)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. POST Add Item (Valid)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "variantId": "{{variantA}}",
  "quantity": 2
}

### 3. GET Cart (Verify Populated & no cost/supplier)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. POST Add Item (Quantity exceeding stock: stock is 2 for variantB)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "variantId": "{{variantB}}",
  "quantity": 5
}

### 5. POST Merge (Overlapping guest items)
# variantA is already in cart (qty 2). variantB is new (qty 1).
# variantA should remain qty 2. variantB should be added with qty 1.
POST http://localhost:5000/api/cart/merge
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guestItems": [
    { "variantId": "{{variantA}}", "quantity": 5 },
    { "variantId": "{{variantB}}", "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### 6. DELETE Item
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/cart/items/{{variantA}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. GET Cart (Verify it's gone)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
